  "metadata": {
    "title": "Workflow 2 - Image Vault Generator",
    "description": "Batch generates vault images using Z-Image Base + trained character LoRA + IPAdapter identity lock. 2-step pipeline (generate + latent upscale 1.5x + refine at denoise 0.2) with YOLOv9c face detailing. 4 lanes with bundle support. Optimized for RTX 5090.",
    "version": "3.1",
    "author": "AI Influencer Pipeline",
    "gpu_target": "RTX 5090 32GB",
    "docker_image": "comfyui:latest-5090",
    "images_per_character": 800,
    "lanes": ["sfw", "suggestive", "spicy", "nsfw"]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [50, 50],
      "size": [450, 300],
      "properties": {
        "text": "WORKFLOW 2: IMAGE VAULT GENERATOR (Z-Image Base)\n====================================\nGenerates 800 images per character (200 per lane)\n\nLanes: SFW | Suggestive | Spicy | NSFW\nPer lane: 80 one-offs + 10x3 + 10x5 + 4x10 bundles\n\n2-STEP PIPELINE:\n  Step 1: Generate at 1024x1024 (40 steps, DPM++ 2M Karras, CFG 4.5)\n  Step 2: Latent upscale 1.5x + refine (20 steps, denoise 0.2)\n  Step 3: FaceDetailer with face_yolov9c.pt\n  Step 4: Film grain + downscale + SeedVR2 upscale to 2048px\n\nIDENTITY LOCK: LoRA + IPAdapter FaceID dual lock\n\nUSAGE:\n1. Set character LoRA in LoRA loader\n2. Set reference image path\n3. Paste prompts from vault manifest\n4. Queue for batch generation\n\nOPTIMIZED FOR: RTX 5090 32GB VRAM\nBATCH MODE: Process prompts sequentially via API"
      }
    },
